10.16.1	data_table/Common Air Fryer Settings and Their Times	<p class="muted t-small">Rough numbers for a 1500&ndash;1700 W basket fryer, <regex>user_name</regex>. Shake halfway through everything.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Food</th><th class="num">Temp</th><th class="num">Time</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Frozen fries</td><td class="num">400&deg;F</td><td class="num">15&ndash;18 min</td><td>Don't crowd; two batches beat one</td></tr><tr><td>Chicken wings</td><td class="num">380&deg;F</td><td class="num">22&ndash;26 min</td><td>Pat dry, toss in oil</td></tr><tr><td>Chicken breast</td><td class="num">375&deg;F</td><td class="num">18&ndash;22 min</td><td>Pound even, 165&deg;F inside</td></tr><tr><td>Broccoli florets</td><td class="num">390&deg;F</td><td class="num">8&ndash;10 min</td><td>Crisp edges, still green</td></tr><tr><td>Salmon fillet</td><td class="num">390&deg;F</td><td class="num">8&ndash;11 min</td><td>Skin down; no flip needed</td></tr><tr><td>Reheated pizza</td><td class="num">350&deg;F</td><td class="num">3&ndash;5 min</td><td>Beats the microwave, honestly</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details class="acc"><summary>Converting an oven recipe</summary><div class="body"><p class="muted">Drop the temperature about 25&deg;F and start checking at 70% of the oven time. Air fryers move heat fast and small.</p></div></details>	<p class="muted t-small">Rough numbers for a 1500&ndash;1700 W basket fryer, . Shake halfway through everything.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Food</th><th class="num">Temp</th><th class="num">Time</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Frozen fries</td><td class="num">400&deg;F</td><td class="num">15&ndash;18 min</td><td>Don't crowd; two batches beat one</td></tr><tr><td>Chicken wings</td><td class="num">380&deg;F</td><td class="num">22&ndash;26 min</td><td>Pat dry, toss in oil</td></tr><tr><td>Chicken breast</td><td class="num">375&deg;F</td><td class="