13.33.0	timeline_view/Six Weeks of Sleeping on the Floor	<div class="stack"><h3 class="card-title">Six Weeks of Sleeping on the Floor</h3><p class="muted t-small">A friend swore by it. I tried it, <regex>user_name</regex>. Here's the log.</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">Night 1–3</span><p>Woke up repeatedly. Everything felt bony. Almost quit twice.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 1</span><p>Added a thick quilt under a thin mat. Slept through once. Victory.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 2</span><p>Hips adjusted. Started waking without the usual low-back stiffness.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 3</span><p>Tried one pillow instead of two. Neck said thank you.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 4</span><p>Noticed I was falling asleep faster. Less tossing.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 6</span><p>Kept a hybrid: mat on the floor on weeknights, bed on weekends.</p></li></ul><div class="callout warn"><p class="t-small">Not a cure-all. If you wake with numbness or sharp pain, stop and ask a professional.</p></div></div>	<div class="stack"><h3 class="card-title">Six Weeks of Sleeping on the Floor</h3><p class="muted t-small">A friend swore by it. I tried it, . Here's the log.</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">Night 1–3</span><p>Woke up repeatedly. Everything felt bony. Almost quit twice.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 1</span><p>Added a thick quilt under a thin mat. Slept through once. Victory.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 2</span><p>Hips adjusted. Started waking without the usual low-back stiffness.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 3</span><p>Tried one pillow instead of two. Neck said thank you.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 4</span><p>Noticed I was falling asleep faster. Less tossing.</p></li><li><span class="when">Week 6</span><p>Kept a hybrid: mat on the floor on weeknights, bed on weekends.</p></li></ul><div class="callout warn"><p class="t-small">Not a cure-all. If you wake with numbness or sharp pain, stop and ask a professional.</p></div></div>	-
13.34.0	timeline_view/Getting a Flat Tyre Fixed, Start to Finish	<div class="stack"><h3 class="card-title">Getting a Flat Tyre Fixed, Start to Finish</h3><p class="muted t-small">A small drama in six acts, <regex>user_name</regex>.</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">08:40</span><p>Car pulls left. Something feels wrong. Pull over and check.</p></li><li><span class="when">08:45</span><p>Rear tyre is flat. A screw, right on the tread.</p></li><li><span class="when">08:55</span><p>Spare on, jack down, hands filthy. Twenty minutes of work.</p></li><li><span class="when">09:30</span><p>Ring three garages. Two can fit me in today, one cannot.</p></li><li><span class="when">11:15</span><p>Dropped off. Told a plug repair may be enough, or a new tyre.</p></li><li><span class="when">13:00</span><p>Collected. Plug held. Cheaper than feared.</p></li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>What to keep in the boot</summary><div class="body"><p class="t-small">Working jack, wheel brace, gloves, and a torch that actually has charge in it.</p></div></details></div>	<div class="stack"><h3 class="card-title">Getting a Flat Tyre Fixed, Start to Finish</h3><p class="muted t-small">A small drama in six acts, .</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">08:40</span><p>Car pulls left. Something feels wrong. Pull over and check.</p></li><li><span class="when">08:45</span><p>Rear tyre is flat. A screw, right on the tread.</p></li><li><span class="when">08:55</span><p>Spare on, jack down, hands filthy. Twenty minutes of work.</p></li><li><span class="when">09:30</span><p>Ring three garages. Two can fit me in today, one cannot.</p></li><li><span class="when">11:15</span><p>Dropped off. Told a plug repair may be enough, or a new tyre.</p></li><li><span class="when">13:00</span><p>Collected. Plug held. Cheaper than feared.</p></li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>What to keep in the boot</summary><div class="body"><p class="t-small">Working jack, wheel brace, gloves, and a torch tha