20.60.0	diagram_simple/The Traffic Light Cycle	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">Traffic light cycle</div><p class="muted t-small">Three states, one rule: nobody trusts yellow, <regex>user_name</regex>.</p><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 150"><rect x="90" y="8" width="120" height="34" rx="6" fill="var(--good-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="150" y="29" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Green — go</text><line x1="210" y1="25" x2="252" y2="25" class="axis"></line><rect x="252" y="8" width="42" height="34" rx="6" fill="var(--panel-2)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="273" y="29" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">30–60s</text><line x1="150" y1="42" x2="150" y2="70" class="axis"></line><rect x="90" y="70" width="120" height="34" rx="6" fill="var(--warn-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="150" y="91" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Yellow — slow</text><line x1="90" y1="87" x2="48" y2="87" class="axis"></line><rect x="6" y="70" width="42" height="34" rx="6" fill="var(--bad-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="27" y="91" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Red</text><line x1="48" y1="104" x2="120" y2="122" class="axis"></line><text x="106" y="140" class="lbl">back to green</text></svg></div><ol class="list t-small"><li>Green: proceed if clear</li><li>Yellow: stop unless unsafe to do so</li><li>Red: stop, the whole point</li></ol></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">Traffic light cycle</div><p class="muted t-small">Three states, one rule: nobody trusts yellow, .</p><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 150"><rect x="90" y="8" width="120" height="34" rx="6" fill="var(--good-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="150" y="29" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Green — go</text><line x1="210" y1="25" x2="252" y2="25" class="axis"></line><rect x="252" y="8" width="42" height="34" rx="6" fill="var(--panel-2)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="273" y="29" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">30–60s</text><line x1="150" y1=