20.20.1	diagram_simple/Bean to Chocolate Bar	<div class="umi-page">  <div class="chart">    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 100" role="img" aria-label="Bean to chocolate bar flow">      <rect x="10" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="60" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Harvest</text>      <line x1="110" y1="50" x2="150" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="150" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="200" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Ferment</text>      <line x1="250" y1="50" x2="290" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="290" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="340" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Dry & Roast</text>      <line x1="390" y1="50" x2="430" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="430" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="480" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Grind</text>      <line x1="530" y1="50" x2="570" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="570" y="20" width="60" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--good-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="600" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Bar</text>    </svg>  </div>  <p class="t-small muted">Cocoa beans become chocolate through harvest, fermentation, drying, roasting, grinding, and molding. Each step builds flavor.</p>  <details class="acc">    <summary>What happens during fermentation?</summary>    <div class="body">      <p>Beans are piled and covered. Microbes break down sugars and pulp, starting flavor development. It takes about 5–7 days.</p>    </div>  </details></div>	<div class="umi-page">  <div class="chart">    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 100" role="img" aria-label="Bean to chocolate bar flow">      <rect x="10" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="60" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Harvest</text>      <line x1="110" y1="50" x2="150" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="150" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="200" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Ferment</text>      <line x1="250" y1="50" x2="290" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="290" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="340" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Dry & Roast</text>      <line x1="390" y1="50" x2="430" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="430" y="20" width="100" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="480" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Grind</text>      <line x1="530" y1="50" x2="570" y2="50" class="axis"></line>      <rect x="570" y="20" width="60" height="60" rx="8" fill="var(--good-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect>      <text x="600" y="55" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Bar</text>    </svg>  </div>  <p class="t-small muted">Cocoa beans become chocolate through harvest, fermentation, drying, roasting, grinding, and molding. Each step builds flavor.</p>  <details class="acc">    <summary>What happens during fermentation?</summary>    <div class="body">      <p>Beans are piled and covered. Microbes break down sugars and pulp, starting flavor development. It takes about 5–7 days.</p>    </div>  </details></div>	-
