20.29.1	diagram_simple/Wi-Fi Signal Journey	<div class="card"><p class="muted t-small">Your data takes a short trip, <regex>user_name</regex>. The long part is the internet.</p><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 330 160" role="img" aria-label="Wi-Fi journey: internet, modem, router, signal, device"><rect x="8" y="55" width="68" height="36" rx="6" fill="var(--panel-2)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="42" y="77" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Internet</text><line x1="76" y1="73" x2="108" y2="73" class="axis"></line><rect x="108" y="55" width="60" height="36" rx="6" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="138" y="77" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Modem</text><line x1="168" y1="73" x2="200" y2="73" class="axis"></line><rect x="200" y="55" width="60" height="36" rx="6" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="230" y="77" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Router</text><path d="M260 91 q10 12 0 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-3)" stroke-width="2"></path><rect x="262" y="112" width="58" height="36" rx="6" fill="var(--good-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="291" y="134" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Your phone</text></svg></div><details class="acc"><summary>Why walls hurt</summary><div class="body"><p>Wi-Fi is radio. Water, brick, and metal soak it up, so each wall steals a little strength.</p></div></details></div>	<div class="card"><p class="muted t-small">Your data takes a short trip, . The long part is the internet.</p><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 330 160" role="img" aria-label="Wi-Fi journey: internet, modem, router, signal, device"><rect x="8" y="55" width="68" height="36" rx="6" fill="var(--panel-2)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x="42" y="77" class="lbl" text-anchor="middle">Internet</text><line x1="76" y1="73" x2="108" y2="73" class="axis"></line><rect x="108" y="55" width="60" height="36" rx="6" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><text x=