21.2.0	illustration/Better Sleep Habits	<article class="msg umi"><span class="who">Umi</span><p>Your bed is for sleeping, <regex>user_name</regex>. Keep the room cool, dark, and boring. Your phone can sleep in the other room.</p><ul class="list"><li>Same wake-up time, even weekends.</li><li>No caffeine after 2 pm.</li><li>Dim the lights an hour before bed.</li></ul><div class="meter"><span style="width: 70%"></span></div><p class="t-small muted">70% of sleep quality comes from consistency.</p></article>	<article class="msg umi"><span class="who">Umi</span><p>Your bed is for sleeping, . Keep the room cool, dark, and boring. Your phone can sleep in the other room.</p><ul class="list"><li>Same wake-up time, even weekends.</li><li>No caffeine after 2 pm.</li><li>Dim the lights an hour before bed.</li></ul><div class="meter"><span style="width: 70%"></span></div><p class="t-small muted">70% of sleep quality comes from consistency.</p></article>	-
21.3.0	illustration/Stretching at Your Desk	<article class="msg umi"><span class="who">Umi</span><p>Every hour, stand up and roll your shoulders back, <regex>user_name</regex>. Ten seconds. That's it.</p><details class="acc"><summary>Three desk stretches</summary><div class="body"><ol class="list"><li>Neck roll: ear to shoulder, hold 10s each side.</li><li>Chest opener: clasp hands behind back, lift.</li><li>Seated twist: hand on opposite knee, look back.</li></ol></div></details><div class="callout good"><p>Do them now. I'll wait. 😊</p></div></article>	<article class="msg umi"><span class="who">Umi</span><p>Every hour, stand up and roll your shoulders back, . Ten seconds. That's it.</p><details class="acc"><summary>Three desk stretches</summary><div class="body"><ol class="list"><li>Neck roll: ear to shoulder, hold 10s each side.</li><li>Chest opener: clasp hands behind back, lift.</li><li>Seated twist: hand on opposite knee, look back.</li></ol></div></details><div class="callout good"><p>Do them now. I'll wait. 😊</p></div></article>	-
