ke="var(--line)"></rect><path d="M168 48h60" stroke="var(--info)" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"></path><text x="198" y="94" text-anchor="middle" class="lbl">loose in a cloth</text></svg></div><p class="t-small muted">Trim the ends like flowers, . Basil hates the cold, so leave that one on the counter.</p></div>	-
