21.51.0	illustration/Getting a Ring Off a Swollen Finger	<div class="callout warn"><p><strong>Purple or numb?</strong> That's a doctor or jeweler visit, not a kitchen trick. Go now.</p></div><div class="card"><ol class="list"><li>Hand up above your heart for five minutes. swelling drains down.</li><li>Spray or soak in cold water.</li><li>Soap or oil over the knuckle, not just the ring.</li><li>Wrap the finger in dental floss past the ring, then unwind the tail to slide it off.</li></ol><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 90" role="img" aria-label="Floss wrapped past the ring and unwound to ease it off"><path d="M30 46h150" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 5"></path><ellipse cx="120" cy="46" rx="14" ry="22" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-2)" stroke-width="6"></ellipse><text x="30" y="82" class="lbl">start</text><text x="168" y="82" class="lbl">pull</text></svg></div><p class="t-small muted">Slow beats strong here, <regex>user_name</regex>. Tugging makes it worse.</p></div>	<div class="callout warn"><p><strong>Purple or numb?</strong> That's a doctor or jeweler visit, not a kitchen trick. Go now.</p></div><div class="card"><ol class="list"><li>Hand up above your heart for five minutes. swelling drains down.</li><li>Spray or soak in cold water.</li><li>Soap or oil over the knuckle, not just the ring.</li><li>Wrap the finger in dental floss past the ring, then unwind the tail to slide it off.</li></ol><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 90" role="img" aria-label="Floss wrapped past the ring and unwound to ease it off"><path d="M30 46h150" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 5"></path><ellipse cx="120" cy="46" rx="14" ry="22" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-2)" stroke-width="6"></ellipse><text x="30" y="82" class="lbl">start</text><text x="168" y="82" class="lbl">pull</text></svg></div><p class="t-small muted">Slow beats strong here, . Tugging makes it worse.</p></div>	-
21.52.0	illustration/Defrosting a Freezer Safely	<div class="card"><div class="row between"><span class="badge good"><i class="dot"></i>safe: hot water bowls, towels, fan</span></div><div class="row between"><span class="badge bad">never: knife, screwdriver, chisel</span></div><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 260 100" role="img" aria-label="A bowl of hot water melting ice, with a barred-out knife"><rect x="14" y="18" width="110" height="66" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-alt)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><path d="M20 26h98" stroke="var(--info)" stroke-width="6"></path><ellipse cx="69" cy="66" rx="26" ry="12" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)"></ellipse><path d="M60 56c4-8 14-8 18 0" fill="none" stroke="var(--warn)" stroke-width="3"></path><text x="69" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="lbl">bowl + steam</text><path d="M160 28l56 52M216 28l-56 52" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><text x="188" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="lbl">no poking</text></svg></div><details class="acc"><summary>Speed it up, <regex>user_name</regex></summary><div class="body"><p>Unplug it first. Bowls of hot water on the shelves, a towel on the floor, and a fan pointed in. A hair dryer on low works too, kept well back from the plastic.</p></div></details></div>	<div class="card"><div class="row between"><span class="badge good"><i class="dot"></i>safe: hot water bowls, towels, fan</span></div><div class="row between"><span class="badge bad">never: knife, screwdriver, chisel</span></div><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 260 100" role="img" aria-label="A bowl of hot water melting ice, with a barred-out knife"><rect x="14" y="18" width="110" height="66" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-alt)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><path d="M20 26h98" stroke="var(--info)" stroke-width="6"></path><ellipse cx="69" cy="66" rx="26" ry="12" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)"></ellipse><path d="M60 56c4-8 14-8 18 0" fill="none" stroke="v