23.39.0	quiz_question/Basic first aid for burns quiz	<div class="quiz"><div class="q">What is the first step for a minor burn?</div><details><summary>A) Apply butter or oil</summary><div class="answer">Incorrect. This traps heat and can cause infection.</div></details><details><summary>B) Cool the burn with running water</summary><div class="answer">Correct. Cool water for 10-20 minutes reduces damage.</div></details><details><summary>C) Pop any blisters</summary><div class="answer">Incorrect. Blisters protect against infection.</div></details><details><summary>D) Cover with a thick bandage immediately</summary><div class="answer">Incorrect. Cool first, then cover loosely.</div></details></div>	<div class="quiz"><div class="q">What is the first step for a minor burn?</div><details><summary>A) Apply butter or oil</summary><div class="answer">Incorrect. This traps heat and can cause infection.</div></details><details><summary>B) Cool the burn with running water</summary><div class="answer">Correct. Cool water for 10-20 minutes reduces damage.</div></details><details><summary>C) Pop any blisters</summary><div class="answer">Incorrect. Blisters protect against infection.</div></details><details><summary>D) Cover with a thick bandage immediately</summary><div class="answer">Incorrect. Cool first, then cover loosely.</div></details></div>	-
