23.50.0	quiz_question/Basic water purification quiz	<div class="quiz umi-page"><div class="q">Which method kills most pathogens in water without added chemicals?</div><details><summary>A) Straining through cloth</summary></details><details><summary>B) Boiling for at least one minute</summary><div class="answer">Yep. A rolling boil for one minute does the job at most elevations. Let it cool, then drink. Cloudy water? Filter it first.</div></details><details><summary>C) Adding a pinch of salt</summary></details><details><summary>D) Leaving it in the sun all day</summary></details></div>	<div class="quiz umi-page"><div class="q">Which method kills most pathogens in water without added chemicals?</div><details><summary>A) Straining through cloth</summary></details><details><summary>B) Boiling for at least one minute</summary><div class="answer">Yep. A rolling boil for one minute does the job at most elevations. Let it cool, then drink. Cloudy water? Filter it first.</div></details><details><summary>C) Adding a pinch of salt</summary></details><details><summary>D) Leaving it in the sun all day</summary></details></div>	-
