23.53.0	quiz_question/Basic Spanish phrases quiz	<div class="umi-page"><div class="card"><div class="card-title">Basic Spanish phrases</div><p class="muted">Let's see how you do, <regex>user_name</regex>. Tap an option to reveal the answer.</p><div class="quiz"><div class="q">How do you say "Good morning"?</div><details><summary>A) Buenas noches</summary></details><details><summary>B) Buenos días</summary><div class="answer">Correct! <em>Buenos días</em> is used before noon. <em>Buenas noches</em> means good evening or good night.</div></details><details><summary>C) Buenas tardes</summary></details></div><div class="quiz"><div class="q">Which phrase means "Thank you"?</div><details><summary>A) Por favor</summary></details><details><summary>B) De nada</summary></details><details><summary>C) Gracias</summary><div class="answer">Right. <em>Gracias</em> = thank you. <em>De nada</em> is "you're welcome," and <em>por favor</em> is "please."</div></details></div><div class="callout info">Fun fact: <em>Buenos días</em> is literally "good days" — plural, even for one day.</div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="card"><div class="card-title">Basic Spanish phrases</div><p class="muted">Let's see how you do, . Tap an option to reveal the answer.</p><div class="quiz"><div class="q">How do you say "Good morning"?</div><details><summary>A) Buenas noches</summary></details><details><summary>B) Buenos días</summary><div class="answer">Correct! <em>Buenos días</em> is used before noon. <em>Buenas noches</em> means good evening or good night.</div></details><details><summary>C) Buenas tardes</summary></details></div><div class="quiz"><div class="q">Which phrase means "Thank you"?</div><details><summary>A) Por favor</summary></details><details><summary>B) De nada</summary></details><details><summary>C) Gracias</summary><div class="answer">Right. <em>Gracias</em> = thank you. <em>De nada</em> is "you're welcome," and <em>por favor</em> is "please."</div></details></div><div 