26.10.0	checklist/Bike commute checklist	<div class="card">  <h4 class="card-title">Bike commute — kit and quick check</h4>  <p class="muted t-small">One minute before you ride: ABC. Air, Brakes, Chain.</p>  <ul class="list">    <li>Tyres firm when you squeeze them</li>    <li>Brakes grip before the lever hits the bar</li>    <li>Chain clean, lightly oiled, not dry-squeaking</li>    <li>Lights on, both ends — even in daylight</li>    <li>Helmet sits level, strap snug under the chin</li>  </ul>  <div class="divider"></div>  <p class="muted t-small"><strong>In the bag</strong></p>  <ul class="list">    <li>Spare inner tube, tyre levers, mini pump</li>    <li>Small lock — a good one if you leave it outside all day</li>    <li>Waterproof jacket that folds into nothing</li>    <li>Work clothes in a dry bag, inside the pack</li>    <li>Phone charged, plus a bus fare for the flat-tyre days</li>  </ul>  <div class="callout warn">Ride a lap of the car park first, <regex>user_name</regex>. Two minutes now saves a wobbly first mile.</div></div>	<div class="card">  <h4 class="card-title">Bike commute — kit and quick check</h4>  <p class="muted t-small">One minute before you ride: ABC. Air, Brakes, Chain.</p>  <ul class="list">    <li>Tyres firm when you squeeze them</li>    <li>Brakes grip before the lever hits the bar</li>    <li>Chain clean, lightly oiled, not dry-squeaking</li>    <li>Lights on, both ends — even in daylight</li>    <li>Helmet sits level, strap snug under the chin</li>  </ul>  <div class="divider"></div>  <p class="muted t-small"><strong>In the bag</strong></p>  <ul class="list">    <li>Spare inner tube, tyre levers, mini pump</li>    <li>Small lock — a good one if you leave it outside all day</li>    <li>Waterproof jacket that folds into nothing</li>    <li>Work clothes in a dry bag, inside the pack</li>    <li>Phone charged, plus a bus fare for the flat-tyre days</li>  </ul>  <div class="callout warn">Ride a lap of the