26.39.0	checklist/First-time blood donation checklist	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><h2>First-time blood donation</h2><p class="muted">It's a kind thing to do. <regex>user_name</regex>, a little prep makes it easy.</p><div class="card"><h4>Before</h4><ul class="list"><li>Eat a good meal—iron-rich if possible.</li><li>Drink plenty of water in the hours before.</li><li>Bring ID and a list of medications.</li><li>Wear sleeves that roll up easily.</li><li>Sleep well the night before.</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>After</h4><ul class="list"><li>Rest for 10–15 minutes and have a snack.</li><li>Keep the bandage on for a few hours.</li><li>Drink extra fluids for the rest of the day.</li><li>Avoid heavy lifting or intense exercise.</li></ul></div><div class="callout good"><p>Feeling lightheaded? Sit or lie down, raise your feet, and tell a staff member. It passes.</p></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><h2>First-time blood donation</h2><p class="muted">It's a kind thing to do. , a little prep makes it easy.</p><div class="card"><h4>Before</h4><ul class="list"><li>Eat a good meal—iron-rich if possible.</li><li>Drink plenty of water in the hours before.</li><li>Bring ID and a list of medications.</li><li>Wear sleeves that roll up easily.</li><li>Sleep well the night before.</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>After</h4><ul class="list"><li>Rest for 10–15 minutes and have a snack.</li><li>Keep the bandage on for a few hours.</li><li>Drink extra fluids for the rest of the day.</li><li>Avoid heavy lifting or intense exercise.</li></ul></div><div class="callout good"><p>Feeling lightheaded? Sit or lie down, raise your feet, and tell a staff member. It passes.</p></div></div></div>	-
26.40.0	checklist/Before a dentist appointment checklist	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><h2>Before a dentist appointment</h2><p class="muted">A little prep makes it smoother. <regex>user_name</regex>, here's your checklist.</p><div class="card"><h4>At home</h4><ul class="list"><li>Brush and floss gently—no need to overdo it.</li><li>Write down any sensitivity or pain you've noticed.</li><li>List medications and allergies.</li><li>Confirm appointment time and location.</li><li>Eat lightly if you're prone to gagging.</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>In the chair</h4><ul class="list"><li>Mention if you're anxious—they can adjust.</li><li>Agree on a hand signal if you need a pause.</li><li>Ask about anything you don't understand.</li></ul></div><div class="callout info"><p>Skip the coffee right before. It can make you jittery and your mouth dry.</p></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><h2>Before a dentist appointment</h2><p class="muted">A little prep makes it smoother. , here's your checklist.</p><div class="card"><h4>At home</h4><ul class="list"><li>Brush and floss gently—no need to overdo it.</li><li>Write down any sensitivity or pain you've noticed.</li><li>List medications and allergies.</li><li>Confirm appointment time and location.</li><li>Eat lightly if you're prone to gagging.</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>In the chair</h4><ul class="list"><li>Mention if you're anxious—they can adjust.</li><li>Agree on a hand signal if you need a pause.</li><li>Ask about anything you don't understand.</li></ul></div><div class="callout info"><p>Skip the coffee right before. It can make you jittery and your mouth dry.</p></div></div></div>	-
