26.46.0	checklist/First day of school checklist	<div class="umi-page"><div class="card"><h4>First day of school checklist</h4><p class="muted">New year, new routine. A little prep tonight makes tomorrow smooth.</p><ul class="list"><li><strong>Backpack ready</strong> — pencils, notebooks, folder, and any forms.</li><li><strong>Lunch packed</strong> — or lunch money in a safe pocket.</li><li><strong>Outfit chosen</strong> — laid out, including socks and shoes.</li><li><strong>Water bottle filled</strong> — label it with your name.</li><li><strong>Alarm set</strong> — give yourself extra time for first-day hiccups.</li><li><strong>Breakfast plan</strong> — something easy and filling.</li><li><strong>Emergency contact info</strong> — in the backpack or memorized.</li><li><strong>Route to school</strong> — know how you're getting there and when to leave.</li><li><strong>Early bedtime</strong> — rest makes everything better.</li></ul><div class="callout good"><p class="t-small">You've got this. First days are a little scary for everyone—even the teachers.</p></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="card"><h4>First day of school checklist</h4><p class="muted">New year, new routine. A little prep tonight makes tomorrow smooth.</p><ul class="list"><li><strong>Backpack ready</strong> — pencils, notebooks, folder, and any forms.</li><li><strong>Lunch packed</strong> — or lunch money in a safe pocket.</li><li><strong>Outfit chosen</strong> — laid out, including socks and shoes.</li><li><strong>Water bottle filled</strong> — label it with your name.</li><li><strong>Alarm set</strong> — give yourself extra time for first-day hiccups.</li><li><strong>Breakfast plan</strong> — something easy and filling.</li><li><strong>Emergency contact info</strong> — in the backpack or memorized.</li><li><strong>Route to school</strong> — know how you're getting there and when to leave.</li><li><strong>Early bedtime</strong> — rest makes everything better.</li></ul><div class="callou