26.3.1	checklist/Before a haircut appointment checklist	<div class="card">  <h4>Before a haircut appointment checklist</h4>  <p class="muted t-small">Bring photos, bring honesty, skip the mystery products.</p>  <ul class="list">    <li>Save two or three reference photos, including one you don't want</li>    <li>Wash hair the day before, not the morning of, so it settles</li>    <li>Come with hair dry, not tied up in a wet bun</li>    <li>Know your routine: how long you'll actually style it</li>    <li>Mention scalp sensitivity, cowlicks, or thinning up front</li>    <li>Say the words "take two inches off" out loud, then agree on a length</li>    <li>Ask what to say to the next stylist so it's repeatable</li>    <li>Book the next appointment before you leave if you like it</li>  </ul>  <p class="muted t-small">One tip, <regex>user_name</regex>: if the brief is vague, the result is a surprise. Speak up early, it's your head.</p></div>	<div class="card">  <h4>Before a haircut appointment checklist</h4>  <p class="muted t-small">Bring photos, bring honesty, skip the mystery products.</p>  <ul class="list">    <li>Save two or three reference photos, including one you don't want</li>    <li>Wash hair the day before, not the morning of, so it settles</li>    <li>Come with hair dry, not tied up in a wet bun</li>    <li>Know your routine: how long you'll actually style it</li>    <li>Mention scalp sensitivity, cowlicks, or thinning up front</li>    <li>Say the words "take two inches off" out loud, then agree on a length</li>    <li>Ask what to say to the next stylist so it's repeatable</li>    <li>Book the next appointment before you leave if you like it</li>  </ul>  <p class="muted t-small">One tip, : if the brief is vague, the result is a surprise. Speak up early, it's your head.</p></div>	-
