26.6.1	checklist/Preparing for a power outage checklist	<div class="card">  <h4>Preparing for a power outage checklist</h4>  <p class="muted t-small">Charge everything now, thank yourself later.</p>  <div class="row between">    <span class="badge accent"><i class="dot"></i>before it hits</span>    <span class="badge info"><i class="dot"></i>cached match</span>  </div>  <details class="acc" open>    <summary>Power and light</summary>    <div class="body">      <ul class="list">        <li>Charge phones, power banks, laptop, and any medical devices</li>        <li>Find torches and headlamps, test the batteries</li>        <li>Keep candles and a lighter together, away from curtains</li>        <li>Set fridge and freezer to their coldest setting</li>      </ul>    </div>  </details>  <details class="acc">    <summary>Warmth, water, and info</summary>    <div class="body">      <ul class="list">        <li>Fill bottles and the kettle with water</li>        <li>Gather blankets, layers, and dry socks</li>        <li>Write down the utility outage number on paper</li>        <li>Keep one radio or a battery pack for news</li>        <li>Plan how to open an electric garage door manually</li>      </ul>    </div>  </details>  <p class="muted t-small">Stay warm out there, <regex>user_name</regex>. Keep the freezer shut and it'll forgive you for days.</p></div>	<div class="card">  <h4>Preparing for a power outage checklist</h4>  <p class="muted t-small">Charge everything now, thank yourself later.</p>  <div class="row between">    <span class="badge accent"><i class="dot"></i>before it hits</span>    <span class="badge info"><i class="dot"></i>cached match</span>  </div>  <details class="acc" open>    <summary>Power and light</summary>    <div class="body">      <ul class="list">        <li>Charge phones, power banks, laptop, and any medical devices</li>        <li>Find torches and headlamps, test the batteries</li>        <li>Keep can