27.38.1	schedule/Sushi Making Evening	<div class="card"><h4>Sushi Night</h4><p class="t-small muted">Rice is the clock. Everything else waits on it.</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">16:30</span><p>Rinse rice until water runs clear, then start the rice cooker.</p></li><li><span class="when">17:00</span><p>Slice cucumber, avocado, mango. Chill on a plate.</p></li><li><span class="when">17:30</span><p>Rice done. Fold in seasoned vinegar, fan it cool to room temp.</p></li><li><span class="when">18:00</span><p>Set out nori, mat, water bowl, sharp knife. <b>Build station.</b></p></li><li><span class="when">18:15</span><p>Roll. First one messy, second one better. That's the deal.</p></li><li><span class="when">19:00</span><p>Eat. Wasabi, soy, pickled ginger, done.</p></li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>Make-ahead notes</summary><div class="body"><ul class="list"><li>Rice vinegar mix: 3 tbsp vinegar, 2 tbsp sugar, 1 tsp salt per 2 cups dry rice.</li><li>Cut rolls with a wet knife, wipe between slices.</li><li>Fish: keep it cold, buy it same day, use it first.</li></ul></div></details></div>	<div class="card"><h4>Sushi Night</h4><p class="t-small muted">Rice is the clock. Everything else waits on it.</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">16:30</span><p>Rinse rice until water runs clear, then start the rice cooker.</p></li><li><span class="when">17:00</span><p>Slice cucumber, avocado, mango. Chill on a plate.</p></li><li><span class="when">17:30</span><p>Rice done. Fold in seasoned vinegar, fan it cool to room temp.</p></li><li><span class="when">18:00</span><p>Set out nori, mat, water bowl, sharp knife. <b>Build station.</b></p></li><li><span class="when">18:15</span><p>Roll. First one messy, second one better. That's the deal.</p></li><li><span class="when">19:00</span><p>Eat. Wasabi, soy, pickled ginger, done.</p></li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>Make-ahead notes</summary><div class="body"><ul class="list"><li>Rice vinegar mix: 3 tbsp vinegar, 2 tbsp sugar, 1 tsp salt per 2 cups dry rice.</li><li>Cut rolls with a wet knife, wipe between slices.</li><li>Fish: keep it cold, buy it same day, use it first.</li></ul></div></details></div>	-
27.39.1	schedule/Baby's Day (Feeds & Naps)	<div class="card"><h4>Baby's Day</h4><p class="t-small muted">Wake windows are a guide, not a contract. Babies improvise.</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">07:00</span><p>Wake, diaper change, first feed.</p></li><li><span class="when">08:00</span><p>Tummy time on the mat, 5–10 min. Keep it short and cheerful.</p></li><li><span class="when">09:00</span><p>Nap 1. Aim for 45–90 min in the crib.</p></li><li><span class="when">10:30</span><p>Feed, change, a little quiet play.</p></li><li><span class="when">12:00</span><p>Nap 2 — usually the longest, 1.5–2 h.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:30</span><p>Feed, then out for a stroller walk or fresh air.</p></li><li><span class="when">16:00</span><p>Nap 3, short, 30–45 min.</p></li><li><span class="when">18:00</span><p>Bath, feed, dim lights, wind down for bed.</p></li><li><span class="when">19:30</span><p>Bedtime. You did it.</p></li></ul></div>	<div class="card"><h4>Baby's Day</h4><p class="t-small muted">Wake windows are a guide, not a contract. Babies improvise.</p><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">07:00</span><p>Wake, diaper change, first feed.</p></li><li><span class="when">08:00</span><p>Tummy time on the mat, 5–10 min. Keep it short and cheerful.</p></li><li><span class="when">09:00</span><p>Nap 1. Aim for 45–90 min in the crib.</p></li><li><span class="when">10:30</span><p>Feed, change, a little quiet play.</p></li><li><span class="when">12:00</span><p>Nap 2 — usually the longest, 1.5–2 h.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:30</span><p>Feed, then out for a stroller walk or fresh air.</p></li><li><span class="when">16:00</span><p>Nap 3, short, 30–45 min.</p></li><li><span class="when">18:00</span><p>Bath, feed, dim lights, wind down for bed.</p></li><li><span class="when">19:30</span><p>Bedtime. You did it.</p></li></ul></div>	-
27.40.1	schedule/Haircut and Salon Visit	<div class="card"><h4>Salon Visit</h4><div class="grid two"><div class="stat"><div class="label">In chair</div><div class="value">2<span class="unit"> h</span></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">Bring</div><div class="value">Photos</div></div></div><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">13:45</span><p>Arrive, check in. Phone off, coat off.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:00</span><p>Consult. Show reference photos. Say the word "short" carefully.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:15</span><p>Wash and scalp massage. This is the good part.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:30</span><p>Cut or color. Relax. Small talk optional.</p></li><li><span class="when">15:45</span><p>Style and dry. Learn how they do it.</p></li><li><span class="when">16:00</span><p>Pay, tip, book the next one before you forget.</p></li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>After-care</summary><div class="body"><p>Wait 48 h before the first wash if you colored. Sleep on a silk pillowcase if you can.</p></div></details></div>	<div class="card"><h4>Salon Visit</h4><div class="grid two"><div class="stat"><div class="label">In chair</div><div class="value">2<span class="unit"> h</span></div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">Bring</div><div class="value">Photos</div></div></div><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">13:45</span><p>Arrive, check in. Phone off, coat off.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:00</span><p>Consult. Show reference photos. Say the word "short" carefully.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:15</span><p>Wash and scalp massage. This is the good part.</p></li><li><span class="when">14:30</span><p>Cut or color. Relax. Small talk optional.</p></li><li><span class="when">15:45</span><p>Style and dry. Learn how they do it.</p></li><li><span class="when">16:00</span><p>Pay, tip, book the next one before you forget.</p></li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>After-care</summary><div class