34.16.0	http_status_table/HTTP Status Codes, The Short List	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">HTTP Status Codes</div><p class="muted">The ones you'll actually see. Full set lives in the RFCs.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>OK — request worked.</td></tr><tr><td>201</td><td>Created — new thing exists.</td></tr><tr><td>204</td><td>No Content — success, nothing to return.</td></tr><tr><td>301</td><td>Moved Permanently.</td></tr><tr><td>302</td><td>Found — temporary detour.</td></tr><tr><td>304</td><td>Not Modified — cached copy is fine.</td></tr><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad Request — malformed.</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized — who are you?</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Forbidden — I know you, still no.</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Not Found.</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too Many Requests — slow down.</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Internal Server Error.</td></tr><tr><td>502</td><td>Bad Gateway — upstream misbehaved.</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Service Unavailable — try later.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">HTTP Status Codes</div><p class="muted">The ones you'll actually see. Full set lives in the RFCs.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>OK — request worked.</td></tr><tr><td>201</td><td>Created — new thing exists.</td></tr><tr><td>204</td><td>No Content — success, nothing to return.</td></tr><tr><td>301</td><td>Moved Permanently.</td></tr><tr><td>302</td><td>Found — temporary detour.</td></tr><tr><td>304</td><td>Not Modified — cached copy is fine.</td></tr><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad Request — malformed.</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized — who are you?</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Forbidden — I know you, still no.</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Not Found.</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too Many Requests — slow down.</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Internal Server Error.</td></tr><tr><td>502</td><td>Bad Gateway — upstream misbehaved.</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Service Unavailable — try later.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	-
34.17.0	http_status_table/HTTP Status Codes, Grouped	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">HTTP Status Code Groups</div><p class="muted">The first digit tells you who's talking.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="stat"><div class="label">1xx</div><div class="value">Info</div><div class="delta">rare, chatty</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">2xx</div><div class="value">Success</div><div class="delta">good news</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">3xx</div><div class="value">Redirect</div><div class="delta">go here instead</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">4xx</div><div class="value">Client</div><div class="delta">you messed up</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">5xx</div><div class="value">Server</div><div class="delta">we messed up</div></div></div></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">HTTP Status Code Groups</div><p class="muted">The first digit tells you who's talking.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="stat"><div class="label">1xx</div><div class="value">Info</div><div class="delta">rare, chatty</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">2xx</div><div class="value">Success</div><div class="delta">good news</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">3xx</div><div class="value">Redirect</div><div class="delta">go here instead</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">4xx</div><div class="value">Client</div><div class="delta">you messed up</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="label">5xx</div><div class="value">Server</div><div class="delta">we messed up</div></div></div></div>	-
34.18.0	http_status_table/401 vs 403, Settled	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">401 vs 403</div><p class="muted">One is "who are you?" The other is "I know you, and no."</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>401</th><th>403</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Means</td><td>Unauthenticated</td><td>Unauthorized</td></tr><tr><td>Fix</td><td>Log in</td><td>Get permission</td></tr><tr><td>Analogy</td><td>No badge</td><td>Badge, wrong door</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">401 vs 403</div><p class="muted">One is "who are you?" The other is "I know you, and no."</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>401</th><th>403</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Means</td><td>Unauthenticated</td><td>Unauthorized</td></tr><tr><td>Fix</td><td>Log in</td><td>Get permission</td></tr><tr><td>Analogy</td><td>No badge</td><td>Badge, wrong door</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	-
34.19.0	http_status_table/HTTP Redirects, Quick	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">Redirect Codes</div><p class="muted">When the server says "not here, over there."</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>301</td><td>Moved Permanently — update your links.</td></tr><tr><td>302</td><td>Found — temporary, keep the old URL.</td></tr><tr><td>303</td><td>See Other — GET that instead.</td></tr><tr><td>307</td><td>Temporary Redirect — method preserved.</td></tr><tr><td>308</td><td>Permanent Redirect — method preserved.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">301/302 often turn POST into GET. 307/308 keep the method.</p></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">Redirect Codes</div><p class="muted">When the server says "not here, over there."</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>301</td><td>Moved Permanently — update your links.</td></tr><tr><td>302</td><td>Found — temporary, keep the old URL.</td></tr><tr><td>303</td><td>See Other — GET that instead.</td></tr><tr><td>307</td><td>Temporary Redirect — method preserved.</td></tr><tr><td>308</td><td>Permanent Redirect — method preserved.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">301/302 often turn POST into GET. 307/308 keep the method.</p></div>	-
34.20.0	http_status_table/5xx Server Errors	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">5xx Server Errors</div><p class="muted">Not your fault. Probably.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>500</td><td>Internal Server Error — something broke.</td></tr><tr><td>501</td><td>Not Implemented — server can't do that.</td></tr><tr><td>502</td><td>Bad Gateway — upstream gave garbage.</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Service Unavailable — overloaded or down.</td></tr><tr><td>504</td><td>Gateway Timeout — upstream too slow.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">5xx Server Errors</div><p class="muted">Not your fault. Probably.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>500</td><td>Internal Server Error — something broke.</td></tr><tr><td>501</td><td>Not Implemented — server can't do that.</td></tr><tr><td>502</td><td>Bad Gateway — upstream gave garbage.</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Service Unavailable — overloaded or down.</td></tr><tr><td>504</td><td>Gateway Timeout — upstream too slow.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	-
34.21.0	http_status_table/4xx Client Errors	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">4xx Client Errors</div><p class="muted">The request had a problem. Usually on your end.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad Request — malformed syntax.</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized — log in first.</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Forbidden — no access.</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Not Found — no such resource.</td></tr><tr><td>405</td><td>Method Not Allowed — wrong verb.</td></tr><tr><td>408</td><td>Request Timeout — took too long.</td></tr><tr><td>409</td><td>Conflict — state clash.</td></tr><tr><td>418</td><td>I'm a teapot — joke code, real RFC.</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too Many Requests — rate limited.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">4xx Client Errors</div><p class="muted">The request had a problem. Usually on your end.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad Request — malformed syntax.</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized — log in first.</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Forbidden — no access.</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Not Found — no such resource.</td></tr><tr><td>405</td><td>Method Not Allowed — wrong verb.</td></tr><tr><td>408</td><td>Request Timeout — took too long.</td></tr><tr><td>409</td><td>Conflict — state clash.</td></tr><tr><td>418</td><td>I'm a teapot — joke code, real RFC.</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too Many Requests — rate limited.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	-
34.22.0	http_status_table/HTTP Codes in Online Shopping	<div class="card"><h3 class="card-title">HTTP Codes in Online Shopping</h3><p class="muted">Your cart speaks HTTP. Here's the short dictionary.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Page loaded, cart visible</td></tr><tr><td>201</td><td>Order placed, new resource created</td></tr><tr><td>301</td><td>Product moved to a new URL</td></tr><tr><td>302</td><td>Temporary redirect after login</td></tr><tr><td>304</td><td>Cart unchanged, use cached copy</td></tr><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad request, maybe missing size</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Not logged in, need credentials</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Logged in but not allowed</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Product no longer exists</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too many requests, slow down</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Server hiccup on checkout</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Store temporarily closed for maintenance</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	<div class="card"><h3 class="card-title">HTTP Codes in Online Shopping</h3><p class="muted">Your cart speaks HTTP. Here's the short dictionary.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Page loaded, cart visible</td></tr><tr><td>201</td><td>Order placed, new resource created</td></tr><tr><td>301</td><td>Product moved to a new URL</td></tr><tr><td>302</td><td>Temporary redirect after login</td></tr><tr><td>304</td><td>Cart unchanged, use cached copy</td></tr><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad request, maybe missing size</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Not logged in, need credentials</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Logged in but not allowed</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Product no longer exists</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too many requests, slow down</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Server hiccup on checkout</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Store temporarily closed for maintenance</td></tr></tbody></table></d