34.47.0	http_status_table/HTTP Codes for Email Sending	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">Email is fussy. Here's what those codes mean when a send fails.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>250</td><td>Message accepted for delivery</td></tr><tr><td>421</td><td>Service not available, try again later</td></tr><tr><td>450</td><td>Mailbox busy, temporary failure</td></tr><tr><td>550</td><td>Mailbox unavailable, message rejected</td></tr><tr><td>554</td><td>Transaction failed, no valid recipients</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">Not all are HTTP, but they act like it. Same idea: the server tells you what went wrong.</p></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">Email is fussy. Here's what those codes mean when a send fails.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>250</td><td>Message accepted for delivery</td></tr><tr><td>421</td><td>Service not available, try again later</td></tr><tr><td>450</td><td>Mailbox busy, temporary failure</td></tr><tr><td>550</td><td>Mailbox unavailable, message rejected</td></tr><tr><td>554</td><td>Transaction failed, no valid recipients</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">Not all are HTTP, but they act like it. Same idea: the server tells you what went wrong.</p></div></div>	-
34.48.0	http_status_table/HTTP Codes in Online Banking	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">When your bank app acts up, it's often one of these.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Transaction processed successfully</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Session expired, please log in again</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Access denied, insufficient permissions</td></tr><tr><td>409</td><td>Conflict, duplicate transaction detected</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Internal server error, try later</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">If you see 409, check your recent transactions first. Double payments are no fun.</p></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">When your bank app acts up, it's often one of these.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Transaction processed successfully</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Session expired, please log in again</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Access denied, insufficient permissions</td></tr><tr><td>409</td><td>Conflict, duplicate transaction detected</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Internal server error, try later</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">If you see 409, check your recent transactions first. Double payments are no fun.</p></div></div>	-
34.49.0	http_status_table/HTTP Codes for Weather Apps	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">Weather apps are mostly API calls. Here's what they shout when things go wrong.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Forecast retrieved successfully</td></tr><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad request, check location format</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Location not found</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too many requests, slow down</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Service unavailable, try again later</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">429 means you're refreshing too often. The weather isn't changing that fast.</p></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">Weather apps are mostly API calls. Here's what they shout when things go wrong.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Forecast retrieved successfully</td></tr><tr><td>400</td><td>Bad request, check location format</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Location not found</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too many requests, slow down</td></tr><tr><td>503</td><td>Service unavailable, try again later</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">429 means you're refreshing too often. The weather isn't changing that fast.</p></div></div>	-
34.50.0	http_status_table/HTTP Codes for Music Streaming	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">When the music stops, these codes often explain why.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Track playing</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized, check subscription</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Forbidden, region locked</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Track not found</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too many requests, pause a moment</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">403 often means the song isn't available in your country. VPN won't help.</p></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">When the music stops, these codes often explain why.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Track playing</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized, check subscription</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Forbidden, region locked</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Track not found</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>Too many requests, pause a moment</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">403 often means the song isn't available in your country. VPN won't help.</p></div></div>	-
