34.52.0	http_status_table/HTTP Codes for Fitness Apps	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">Your workout didn't save? These codes might be why.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Workout saved</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized, re-login</td></tr><tr><td>409</td><td>Conflict, duplicate activity</td></tr><tr><td>422</td><td>Unprocessable, bad data</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Server error, try later</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">422 often means your device sent weird numbers. Restart the app.</p></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><div class="stack"><p class="muted">Your workout didn't save? These codes might be why.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>200</td><td>Workout saved</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>Unauthorized, re-login</td></tr><tr><td>409</td><td>Conflict, duplicate activity</td></tr><tr><td>422</td><td>Unprocessable, bad data</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>Server error, try later</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="t-small dim">422 often means your device sent weird numbers. Restart the app.</p></div></div>	-
