34.15.1	http_status_table/HTTP Codes for Board Game Night	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">HTTP Codes for Board Game Night</div><p class="muted"><regex>user_name</regex>, the table is a server. Your friends are clients. One of them keeps timing out.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>100 Continue</td><td>Everyone agreed on a game. Progress! For now.</td></tr><tr><td>200 OK</td><td>Rules explained, snacks out, nobody flipped the board.</td></tr><tr><td>201 Created</td><td>New house rule invented: no alliances in Catan. It's law now.</td></tr><tr><td>204 No Content</td><td>You won. Nobody wants to talk about it.</td></tr><tr><td>301 Moved Permanently</td><td>Game night relocated to the kitchen table. The good table.</td></tr><tr><td>400 Bad Request</td><td>Someone tried to play a blue card in Uno. The rules committee objects.</td></tr><tr><td>401 Unauthorized</td><td>You want to be the banker? Show me your credentials.</td></tr><tr><td>403 Forbidden</td><td>No, you cannot "just take one more turn."</td></tr><tr><td>404 Not Found</td><td>Where did the last Catan sheep go? Nobody knows.</td></tr><tr><td>409 Conflict</td><td>Two players both declare the same territory. Blood feud begins.</td></tr><tr><td>410 Gone</td><td>The piece you needed rolled under the couch. Accept it.</td></tr><tr><td>429 Too Many Requests</td><td>You've asked to trade wheat four times this round. Enough.</td></tr><tr><td>500 Internal Server Error</td><td>Rules dispute. The rulebook is lost. Chaos is now canon.</td></tr><tr><td>503 Service Unavailable</td><td>Someone's phone died and they left to charge it. Game paused indefinitely.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>	<div class="card"><div class="card-title">HTTP Codes for Board Game Night</div><p class="muted">, the table is a server. Your friends are clients. One of them keeps timing out.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>