35.22.0	html_cheat_sheet/Houseplant Care Cheat Sheet	<div class="umi-page stack">  <div class="card">    <h2 class="card-title">Houseplant Care Cheat Sheet <span class="badge accent"><i class="dot"></i>cached match</span></h2>    <p class="muted">Most houseplants die of kindness, <regex>user_name</regex>. Usually too much water.</p>    <div class="table-wrap">      <table>        <thead><tr><th>Plant</th><th>Light</th><th>Water</th></tr></thead>        <tbody>          <tr><td>Pothos</td><td>Any, even dim</td><td>When top soil is dry</td></tr>          <tr><td>Snake plant</td><td>Bright, indirect</td><td>Every 2-3 weeks</td></tr>          <tr><td>Monstera</td><td>Bright, indirect</td><td>Weekly in summer</td></tr>          <tr><td>Fern</td><td>Shade, humid</td><td>Keep soil damp</td></tr>          <tr><td>Succulent</td><td>Sunny window</td><td>Monthly, soak then dry</td></tr>        </tbody>      </table>    </div>  </div>  <details class="acc">    <summary>Reading the leaves</summary>    <div class="body stack">      <p class="t-small"><strong>Yellow, soft:</strong> too much water. <strong>Crisp, brown edges:</strong> too dry or too sunny.</p>      <p class="t-small"><strong>Leaning to the window:</strong> rotate the pot a quarter turn weekly.</p>      <p class="t-small"><strong>Dropping leaves:</strong> a draught, or a sudden move.</p>    </div>  </details>  <div class="callout warn">    <p class="t-small">A finger in the soil beats a schedule. If it's damp an inch down, wait.</p>  </div></div>	<div class="umi-page stack">  <div class="card">    <h2 class="card-title">Houseplant Care Cheat Sheet <span class="badge accent"><i class="dot"></i>cached match</span></h2>    <p class="muted">Most houseplants die of kindness, . Usually too much water.</p>    <div class="table-wrap">      <table>        <thead><tr><th>Plant</th><th>Light</th><th>Water</th></tr></thead>        <tbody>          <tr><td>Pothos</td><td>Any, even dim</td><td>