35.21.1	html_cheat_sheet/Everyday Emergency Go-Bag Checklist	<div class="card">  <p class="card-title">Emergency Go-Bag, Under 20 Lbs</p>  <p class="muted">Short list for <regex>user_name</regex>. Pack it once, forget it, check it twice a year.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="stat"><span class="label">Target weight</span><span class="value">7 <span class="unit">kg</span></span></div>    <div class="stat"><span class="label">Check every</span><span class="value">6 <span class="unit">mo</span></span></div>  </div>  <ol class="list">    <li>Water bottle + purification tablets</li>    <li>Energy bars, nut butter, hard candy</li>    <li>Headlamp, spare batteries</li>    <li>Phone cable + small power bank</li>    <li>Rain shell, socks, one base layer</li>    <li>Copies of documents, small cash</li>  </ol>  <details class="acc">    <summary>If you have a pet</summary>    <div class="body">      <ul class="list">        <li>3 days of food, collapsible bowl</li>        <li>Leash, harness, waste bags</li>        <li>Copy of vaccination record</li>      </ul>    </div>  </details>  <div class="callout good">Roll clothes, don't fold. It's the oldest trick and it still works.</div></div>	<div class="card">  <p class="card-title">Emergency Go-Bag, Under 20 Lbs</p>  <p class="muted">Short list for . Pack it once, forget it, check it twice a year.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="stat"><span class="label">Target weight</span><span class="value">7 <span class="unit">kg</span></span></div>    <div class="stat"><span class="label">Check every</span><span class="value">6 <span class="unit">mo</span></span></div>  </div>  <ol class="list">    <li>Water bottle + purification tablets</li>    <li>Energy bars, nut butter, hard candy</li>    <li>Headlamp, spare batteries</li>    <li>Phone cable + small power bank</li>    <li>Rain shell, socks, one base layer</li>    <li>Copies of documents, small cash</li>  </ol>  <details class="