37.5.0	dashboard_split/Sleep better	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Sleep better</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Evening habits</h4><ul class="list"><li>No caffeine after 2pm</li><li>Dim lights 1h before</li><li>No screens 30 min before</li><li>Cool, dark room</li><li>Same bedtime daily</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>Wind-down</h4><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">9:00</span> Tea, no work</li><li><span class="when">9:30</span> Read</li><li><span class="when">10:00</span> Stretch</li><li><span class="when">10:15</span> Lights out</li></ul></div></div><details class="acc"><summary>If you can't sleep</summary><div class="body"><p>Get up after 20 min. Do something boring in dim light. Return when drowsy.</p></div></details></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Sleep better</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Evening habits</h4><ul class="list"><li>No caffeine after 2pm</li><li>Dim lights 1h before</li><li>No screens 30 min before</li><li>Cool, dark room</li><li>Same bedtime daily</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>Wind-down</h4><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">9:00</span> Tea, no work</li><li><span class="when">9:30</span> Read</li><li><span class="when">10:00</span> Stretch</li><li><span class="when">10:15</span> Lights out</li></ul></div></div><details class="acc"><summary>If you can't sleep</summary><div class="body"><p>Get up after 20 min. Do something boring in dim light. Return when drowsy.</p></div></details></div>	-
37.6.0	dashboard_split/Houseplants	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Houseplants</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Care by light</h4><ul class="list"><li><strong>Low light:</strong> pothos, snake plant, ZZ plant</li><li><strong>Medium:</strong> peace lily, philodendron</li><li><strong>Bright indirect:</strong> monstera, fiddle leaf fig</li></ul><p class="muted t-small">Water when the top inch of soil is dry, not on a fixed day.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>Common fixes</h4><div class="callout warn"><strong>Yellow leaves</strong> usually mean overwatering. Let the soil dry out before the next drink.</div><div class="callout info"><strong>Brown tips</strong> often point to tap water minerals. Try filtered or rested water.</div></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Houseplants</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Care by light</h4><ul class="list"><li><strong>Low light:</strong> pothos, snake plant, ZZ plant</li><li><strong>Medium:</strong> peace lily, philodendron</li><li><strong>Bright indirect:</strong> monstera, fiddle leaf fig</li></ul><p class="muted t-small">Water when the top inch of soil is dry, not on a fixed day.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>Common fixes</h4><div class="callout warn"><strong>Yellow leaves</strong> usually mean overwatering. Let the soil dry out before the next drink.</div><div class="callout info"><strong>Brown tips</strong> often point to tap water minerals. Try filtered or rested water.</div></div></div></div>	-
37.7.0	dashboard_split/Chess openings	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Chess openings</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Start here</h4><ol class="list"><li>Control the centre with e4 or d4.</li><li>Develop knights before bishops.</li><li>Castle early.</li><li>Connect your rooks.</li></ol></div><div class="card"><h4>Three to try</h4><div class="grid two"><div class="stat"><span class="label">London System</span><span class="value">1.d4<small class="unit"> + Nf3</small></span></div><div class="stat"><span class="label">Italian Game</span><span class="value">1.e4<small class="unit"> e5</small></span></div></div><details class="acc"><summary>Why the London?</summary><div class="body"><p>Same setup almost every game. Fewer things to memorise, more time to think.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Chess openings</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Start here</h4><ol class="list"><li>Control the centre with e4 or d4.</li><li>Develop knights before bishops.</li><li>Castle early.</li><li>Connect your rooks.</li></ol></div><div class="card"><h4>Three to try</h4><div class="grid two"><div class="stat"><span class="label">London System</span><span class="value">1.d4<small class="unit"> + Nf3</small></span></div><div class="stat"><span class="label">Italian Game</span><span class="value">1.e4<small class="unit"> e5</small></span></div></div><details class="acc"><summary>Why the London?</summary><div class="body"><p>Same setup almost every game. Fewer things to memorise, more time to think.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	-
37.8.0	dashboard_split/Resume writing	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Resume writing</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Structure</h4><ul class="list"><li><strong>Header:</strong> name, contact, links</li><li><strong>Summary:</strong> one or two lines, tailored</li><li><strong>Experience:</strong> verbs first, numbers where you can</li><li><strong>Skills:</strong> match the job ad</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>Quick check</h4><div class="callout good">One page is plenty under ten years of experience.</div><div class="callout warn">Skip the photo and the birth date in most markets.</div><blockquote class="quote">Led a team of four and cut turnaround by 30%.<cite>Strong bullet, action + result</cite></blockquote></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Resume writing</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Structure</h4><ul class="list"><li><strong>Header:</strong> name, contact, links</li><li><strong>Summary:</strong> one or two lines, tailored</li><li><strong>Experience:</strong> verbs first, numbers where you can</li><li><strong>Skills:</strong> match the job ad</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>Quick check</h4><div class="callout good">One page is plenty under ten years of experience.</div><div class="callout warn">Skip the photo and the birth date in most markets.</div><blockquote class="quote">Led a team of four and cut turnaround by 30%.<cite>Strong bullet, action + result</cite></blockquote></div></div></div>	-
37.9.0	dashboard_split/First aid basics	<div class="umi-page"><h1>First aid basics</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Minor burn</h4><ol class="list"><li>Cool under running water 20 minutes.</li><li>Remove tight items near the area.</li><li>Cover loosely, don't pop blisters.</li></ol></div><div class="card"><h4>When to call for help</h4><div class="callout bad">Call emergency services for trouble breathing, heavy bleeding, or loss of consciousness.</div><div class="callout info">For a small cut: press with clean gauze, then wash and cover.</div><div class="callout warn">Nosebleed? Lean forward, pinch the soft part, ten minutes.</div></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>First aid basics</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Minor burn</h4><ol class="list"><li>Cool under running water 20 minutes.</li><li>Remove tight items near the area.</li><li>Cover loosely, don't pop blisters.</li></ol></div><div class="card"><h4>When to call for help</h4><div class="callout bad">Call emergency services for trouble breathing, heavy bleeding, or loss of consciousness.</div><div class="callout info">For a small cut: press with clean gauze, then wash and cover.</div><div class="callout warn">Nosebleed? Lean forward, pinch the soft part, ten minutes.</div></div></div></div>	-
37.10.0	dashboard_split/Gardening	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Gardening</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Season plan</h4><div class="timeline"><ul class="list"><li><span class="when">Spring</span> sow tomatoes indoors</li><li><span class="when">Early summer</span> transplant after frost</li><li><span class="when">Late summer</span> feed and water deeply</li><li><span class="when">Autumn</span> compost and mulch</li></ul></div></div><div class="card"><h4>Fix leggy seedlings</h4><p>They're stretching for light. Move them closer to a window or under a grow lamp, and turn them daily.</p><div class="callout good">Pinch off the bottom leaves and bury stems deeper when you plant out.</div></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Gardening</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Season plan</h4><div class="timeline"><ul class="list"><li><span class="when">Spring</span> sow tomatoes indoors</li><li><span class="when">Early summer</span> transplant after frost</li><li><span class="when">Late summer</span> feed and water deeply</li><li><span class="when">Autumn</span> compost and mulch</li></ul></div></div><div class="card"><h4>Fix leggy seedlings</h4><p>They're stretching for light. Move them closer to a window or under a grow lamp, and turn them daily.</p><div class="callout good">Pinch off the bottom leaves and bury stems deeper when you plant out.</div></div></div></div>	-
37.11.0	dashboard_split/Public speaking	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Public speaking</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Prep</h4><ul class="list"><li>Know your one main point.</li><li>Open with a story, close with a call.</li><li>Practise out loud, standing up.</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>On stage</h4><div class="callout info"><strong>Hands:</strong> rest them, gesture on purpose. Fidgeting reads as nerves.</div><div class="callout good"><strong>Pace:</strong> slow down, pause after key lines. Silence is a tool.</div><details class="acc"><summary>If you freeze</summary><div class="body"><p>Take one breath, look at a friendly face, and say the last sentence again.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Public speaking</h1><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4>Prep</h4><ul class="list"><li>Know your one main point.</li><li>Open with a story, close with a call.</li><li>Practise out loud, standing up.</li></ul></div><div class="card"><h4>On stage</h4><div class="callout info"><strong>Hands:</strong> rest them, gesture on purpose. Fidgeting reads as nerves.</div><div class="callout good"><strong>Pace:</strong> slow down, pause after key lines. Silence is a tool.</div><details class="acc"><summary>If you freeze</summary><div class="body"><p>Take one breath, look at a friendly face, and say the last sentence again.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	-
37.12.0	dashboard_split/Composting at home	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Composting at home</h1><p class="muted">Hey <regex>user_name</regex> — small bin, big payoff.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Greens vs browns</h4><div class="meter"><span style="width:60%"></span></div><p class="dim t-small">Aim for ~2 parts brown to 1 part green.</p><ul class="list"><li><b>Greens</b> — veg peels, coffee grounds, grass</li><li><b>Browns</b> — dry leaves, cardboard, paper</li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>Smells bad?</summary><div class="body"><p>Too wet or too many greens. Add browns and turn it.</p></div></details></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">What stays out</h4><span class="badge bad"><i class="dot"></i>Skip these</span><ul class="list"><li>Meat, fish, dairy</li><li>Oily leftovers</li><li>Pet waste</li></ul><p class="t-small muted">Bokashi or a service handles those if you want them gone too.</p></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Composting at home</h1><p class="muted">Hey  — small bin, big payoff.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Greens vs browns</h4><div class="meter"><span style="width:60%"></span></div><p class="dim t-small">Aim for ~2 parts brown to 1 part green.</p><ul class="list"><li><b>Greens</b> — veg peels, coffee grounds, grass</li><li><b>Browns</b> — dry leaves, cardboard, paper</li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>Smells bad?</summary><div class="body"><p>Too wet or too many greens. Add browns and turn it.</p></div></details></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">What stays out</h4><span class="badge bad"><i class="dot"></i>Skip these</span><ul class="list"><li>Meat, fish, dairy</li><li>Oily leftovers</li><li>Pet waste</li></ul><p class="t-small muted">Bokashi or a service handles those if you want them gone too.</p></div></div></div>	-
37.13.0	dashboard_split/Car maintenance basics	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Car maintenance basics</h1><p class="muted">Five minutes a month keeps <regex>user_name</regex> off the tow truck.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Monthly walk-around</h4><ul class="list"><li>Tire pressure — driver's door sticker, not the tire</li><li>Oil level — cold engine, flat ground</li><li>Lights, front and back</li><li>Wiper blades — cracked rubber? swap them</li></ul></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Rough intervals</h4><div class="table-wrap"><table><tr><th>Item</th><th class="num">Miles</th></tr><tr><td>Oil (synthetic)</td><td class="num">7,500</td></tr><tr><td>Tires rotated</td><td class="num">6,000</td></tr><tr><td>Air filter</td><td class="num">15,000</td></tr></table></div><details class="acc"><summary>Weird noise?</summary><div class="body"><p>Squeal on braking = pads. Squeal on start = belt. Either way, get it looked at this week.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Car maintenance basics</h1><p class="muted">Five minutes a month keeps  off the tow truck.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Monthly walk-around</h4><ul class="list"><li>Tire pressure — driver's door sticker, not the tire</li><li>Oil level — cold engine, flat ground</li><li>Lights, front and back</li><li>Wiper blades — cracked rubber? swap them</li></ul></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Rough intervals</h4><div class="table-wrap"><table><tr><th>Item</th><th class="num">Miles</th></tr><tr><td>Oil (synthetic)</td><td class="num">7,500</td></tr><tr><td>Tires rotated</td><td class="num">6,000</td></tr><tr><td>Air filter</td><td class="num">15,000</td></tr></table></div><details class="acc"><summary>Weird noise?</summary><div class="body"><p>Squeal on braking = pads. Squeal on start = belt. Either way, get it looked at this week.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	-
37.14.0	dashboard_split/Photography basics	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Photography basics</h1><p class="muted">Light first, gear later, <regex>user_name</regex>.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">The exposure triangle</h4><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 80"><rect class="bar" x="10" y="40" width="40" height="30"></rect><rect class="bar alt" x="70" y="20" width="40" height="50"></rect><line class="axis" x1="0" y1="75" x2="200" y2="75"></line></svg></div><ul class="list"><li><b>Aperture</b> — blur the background (low f-number)</li><li><b>Shutter</b> — freeze motion (1/500s+)</li><li><b>ISO</b> — brighter, but grainier</li></ul></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Quick wins</h4><ul class="list"><li>Golden hour: an hour after sunrise, before sunset</li><li>Move your feet, not the zoom</li><li>Rule of thirds — put the subject off-center</li><li>Tap to focus, then drag the brightness down a notch</li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>Blurry shots?</summary><div class="body"><p>Usually too little light, so the shutter stays open too long. Find light or steady your elbows.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Photography basics</h1><p class="muted">Light first, gear later, .</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">The exposure triangle</h4><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 80"><rect class="bar" x="10" y="40" width="40" height="30"></rect><rect class="bar alt" x="70" y="20" width="40" height="50"></rect><line class="axis" x1="0" y1="75" x2="200" y2="75"></line></svg></div><ul class="list"><li><b>Aperture</b> — blur the background (low f-number)</li><li><b>Shutter</b> — freeze motion (1/500s+)</li><li><b>ISO</b> — brighter, but grainier</li></ul></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Quick wins</h4><ul class="list"><li>Golden hour: an hour after sunrise, before sunset</li><li>Move your feet, not the zoom</li><li>Rule of thirds — put the subject off-center</li><li>Tap to focus, then drag the brightness down a notch</li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>Blurry shots?</summary><div class="body"><p>Usually too little light, so the shutter stays open too long. Find light or steady your elbows.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	-
37.15.0	dashboard_split/Cooking rice and grains	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Cooking rice &amp; grains</h1><p class="muted">Ratios you can keep in your head, <regex>user_name</regex>.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Ratio + time</h4><div class="table-wrap"><table><tr><th>Grain</th><th class="num">Water</th><th class="num">Min</th></tr><tr><td>White rice</td><td class="num">1½:1</td><td class="num">15</td></tr><tr><td>Brown rice</td><td class="num">2:1</td><td class="num">40</td></tr><tr><td>Quinoa</td><td class="num">2:1</td><td class="num">15</td></tr><tr><td>Farro</td><td class="num">3:1</td><td class="num">30</td></tr></table></div></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Method that works</h4><ol class="list"><li>Rinse until the water runs clear</li><li>Bring to a boil, then drop to the lowest simmer</li><li>Lid on. Don't stir. Don't peek.</li><li>Rest 10 min off heat, then fluff with a fork</li></ol><details class="acc"><summary>Still mushy?</summary><div class="body"><p>You stirred it or added too much water. Spread it on a tray for five minutes — steam escapes, texture recovers.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Cooking rice &amp; grains</h1><p class="muted">Ratios you can keep in your head, .</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Ratio + time</h4><div class="table-wrap"><table><tr><th>Grain</th><th class="num">Water</th><th class="num">Min</th></tr><tr><td>White rice</td><td class="num">1½:1</td><td class="num">15</td></tr><tr><td>Brown rice</td><td class="num">2:1</td><td class="num">40</td></tr><tr><td>Quinoa</td><td class="num">2:1</td><td class="num">15</td></tr><tr><td>Farro</td><td class="num">3:1</td><td class="num">30</td></tr></table></div></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Method that works</h4><ol class="list"><li>Rinse until the water runs clear</li><li>Bring to a boil, then drop to the lowest simmer</li><li>Lid on. Don't stir. Don't peek.</li><li>Rest 10 min off heat, then fluff with a fork</li></ol><details class="acc"><summary>Still mushy?</summary><div class="body"><p>You stirred it or added too much water. Spread it on a tray for five minutes — steam escapes, texture recovers.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	-
37.16.0	dashboard_split/Travelling cheap	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Travelling cheap</h1><p class="muted">Same trip, smaller bill. Nice to meet you, <regex>user_name</regex>.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Where the money goes</h4><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 80"><rect class="bar" x="10" y="25" width="30" height="45"></rect><rect class="bar alt" x="55" y="40" width="30" height="30"></rect><rect class="bar" x="100" y="50" width="30" height="20"></rect><line class="axis" x1="0" y1="75" x2="200" y2="75"></line></svg></div><p class="dim t-small">Flights, lodging, food — in that order.</p></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Habits that save</h4><ul class="list"><li>Fly Tuesday–Wednesday, early</li><li>Book 3–8 weeks out for domestic</li><li>Stay 15 min from the center, walk or transit in</li><li>Lunch out, dinner from a market</li><li>One card, no foreign fees</li></ul><details class="acc"><summary>Flexible dates?</summary><div class="body"><p>Whole-week views beat single-day searches. Shifting by two days is often the entire discount.</p></div></details></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Travelling cheap</h1><p class="muted">Same trip, smaller bill. Nice to meet you, .</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Where the money goes</h4><div class="chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 80"><rect class="bar" x="10" y="25" width="30" height="45"></rect><rect class="bar alt" x="55" y="40" width="30" height="30"></rect><rect class="bar" x="100" y="50" width="30" height="20"></rect><line class="axis" x1="0" y1="75" x2="200" y2="75"></line></svg></div><p class="dim t-small">Flights, lodging, food — in that order.</p></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Habits that save</h4><ul class="list"><li>Fly Tuesday–Wednesday, early</li><li>Book 3–8 weeks out for domestic</li><li>Stay 15 min from the center, walk or transit in</li><li>Lunch out, dinner from a market</li><li>One card, no f