37.25.0	dashboard_split/Mending clothes	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Mending clothes</h1><p class="muted">Small fixes that save a favourite shirt.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Starter kit</h4><ul class="list"><li>Needles: sharp for woven, blunt for knits.</li><li>Thread: match colour, or go contrast.</li><li>Thimble, scissors, pins.</li><li>A small tin to keep it all.</li></ul><div class="callout good"><p><strong>Good news:</strong> a button takes two minutes.</p></div></div><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Three fixes</h4><div class="timeline"><ul class="list"><li><span class="when">Button</span> Anchor thread, cross the holes, wrap shank.</li><li><span class="when">Hole</span> Pin a patch behind, stitch around, or use a visible patch.</li><li><span class="when">Sock</span> Darning mushroom (or a mug) and a running stitch.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="card flat"><h4 class="card-title">Practice mindset</h4><p class="t-small">First stitches look wobbly. That's normal. The clothes don't mind.</p><div class="row"><span class="badge good">Mended: 1 shirt</span><span class="badge">Skill: beginner</span></div></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Mending clothes</h1><p class="muted">Small fixes that save a favourite shirt.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Starter kit</h4><ul class="list"><li>Needles: sharp for woven, blunt for knits.</li><li>Thread: match colour, or go contrast.</li><li>Thimble, scissors, pins.</li><li>A small tin to keep it all.</li></ul><div class="callout good"><p><strong>Good news:</strong> a button takes two minutes.</p></div></div><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Three fixes</h4><div class="timeline"><ul class="list"><li><span class="when">Button</span> Anchor thread, cross the holes, wrap shank.</li><li><span class="when">Hole</span> Pin a patch behind, stitch around, or use a visible patch.</li><li><span class="when">Sock</span> Darning mushroom (or a mug