42.14.1	dashboard_cards/Laundry Care Dashboard	<div class="umi-page">  <h1>Laundry Care</h1>  <p class="muted">Keep your clothes looking newer, longer.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="card">      <h4>Wash Temps</h4>      <p>Cold for darks and delicates, warm for lights, hot for towels and bedding.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Drying</h4>      <p>Air-dry wool and synthetics. Tumble low for cottons. Remove promptly to reduce wrinkles.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Stain Removal</h4>      <p>Blot, don't rub. Cold water first. Enzyme cleaner for protein stains.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Sorting</h4>      <p>Whites, lights, darks, towels. Wash new dark items separately first time.</p>    </div>  </div>  <div class="card flat">    <h4>Quick Tip</h4>    <p>Turn clothes inside out before washing to protect color and surface.</p>  </div></div>	<div class="umi-page">  <h1>Laundry Care</h1>  <p class="muted">Keep your clothes looking newer, longer.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="card">      <h4>Wash Temps</h4>      <p>Cold for darks and delicates, warm for lights, hot for towels and bedding.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Drying</h4>      <p>Air-dry wool and synthetics. Tumble low for cottons. Remove promptly to reduce wrinkles.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Stain Removal</h4>      <p>Blot, don't rub. Cold water first. Enzyme cleaner for protein stains.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Sorting</h4>      <p>Whites, lights, darks, towels. Wash new dark items separately first time.</p>    </div>  </div>  <div class="card flat">    <h4>Quick Tip</h4>    <p>Turn clothes inside out before washing to protect color and surface.</p>  </div></div>	-
