42.16.1	dashboard_cards/First Aid Basics Dashboard	<div class="umi-page">  <h1>First Aid Basics</h1>  <p class="muted">Quick reminders. Always call emergency services for serious injuries.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="card">      <h4>Minor Cuts</h4>      <p>Clean with water. Apply pressure. Cover with sterile bandage. Change daily.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Burns</h4>      <p>Cool with running water 10–20 min. Don't ice. Cover loosely. No butter.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Sprains</h4>      <p>Rest, Ice, Compression, Elevation (RICE). Avoid heat first 48 hours.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Choking</h4>      <p>5 back blows, 5 abdominal thrusts. Alternate until object clears.</p>    </div>  </div>  <div class="callout warn">When in doubt, call for help. Better safe than sorry.</div></div>	<div class="umi-page">  <h1>First Aid Basics</h1>  <p class="muted">Quick reminders. Always call emergency services for serious injuries.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="card">      <h4>Minor Cuts</h4>      <p>Clean with water. Apply pressure. Cover with sterile bandage. Change daily.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Burns</h4>      <p>Cool with running water 10–20 min. Don't ice. Cover loosely. No butter.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Sprains</h4>      <p>Rest, Ice, Compression, Elevation (RICE). Avoid heat first 48 hours.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Choking</h4>      <p>5 back blows, 5 abdominal thrusts. Alternate until object clears.</p>    </div>  </div>  <div class="callout warn">When in doubt, call for help. Better safe than sorry.</div></div>	-
