42.18.1	dashboard_cards/Time Management Dashboard	<div class="umi-page">  <h1>Time Management</h1>  <p class="muted">Make the hours behave.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="card">      <h4>Pomodoro</h4>      <p>25 min work, 5 min break. After 4 cycles, take 15–30 min.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Eisenhower Matrix</h4>      <p>Urgent & important: do now. Important, not urgent: schedule. Urgent, not important: delegate. Neither: delete.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Time Blocking</h4>      <p>Assign every hour a task. Protect deep work blocks.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Two-Minute Rule</h4>      <p>If it takes less than 2 minutes, do it immediately.</p>    </div>  </div>  <div class="card flat">    <h4>Quick Tip</h4>    <p>Batch similar tasks together to reduce context switching.</p>  </div></div>	<div class="umi-page">  <h1>Time Management</h1>  <p class="muted">Make the hours behave.</p>  <div class="grid two">    <div class="card">      <h4>Pomodoro</h4>      <p>25 min work, 5 min break. After 4 cycles, take 15–30 min.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Eisenhower Matrix</h4>      <p>Urgent & important: do now. Important, not urgent: schedule. Urgent, not important: delegate. Neither: delete.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Time Blocking</h4>      <p>Assign every hour a task. Protect deep work blocks.</p>    </div>    <div class="card">      <h4>Two-Minute Rule</h4>      <p>If it takes less than 2 minutes, do it immediately.</p>    </div>  </div>  <div class="card flat">    <h4>Quick Tip</h4>    <p>Batch similar tasks together to reduce context switching.</p>  </div></div>	-
