42.33.1	dashboard_cards/Vinyl Record Care Dashboard	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Vinyl &amp; Turntable</h1><p class="muted">Afternoon, <regex>user_name</regex>. The needle is older than you think.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Stylus Hours</h4><div class="stat"><span class="value">412<span class="unit">h</span></span><span class="delta down">~588 left</span></div><div class="meter"><div class="progress"><span style="width:41%"></span></div></div></div><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Tracking Force</h4><div class="stat"><span class="value">2.0<span class="unit">g</span></span></div></div><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Anti-skate</h4><p class="t-small">Match to tracking force, same number.</p></div><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Last Clean</h4><p class="t-small">Carbon brush today. Wet clean every 10 plays.</p></div></div><div class="callout warn"><p><strong>Replace by:</strong> roughly 1,000 hours. Note the date you fitted it — future you says thanks.</p></div><details class="acc"><summary>Care routine, in order</summary><div class="body"><ol class="list"><li>Brush stylus back-to-front, never side-to-side.</li><li>Anti-static inner sleeves beat paper ones.</li><li>Store upright. Leaning warps over years.</li><li>Keep speakers off the same shelf as the deck.</li></ol></div></details><details class="acc"><summary>Cleaning checklist</summary><div class="body"><ul class="list"><li>Carbon fibre brush — every play</li><li>Stylus gel — weekly</li><li>Record cleaning solution — monthly, distiled water rinse</li><li>Belt tension check — quarterly</li></ul></div></details><p class="dim t-small">Next stylus audit: fit-date + 1,000 hours. Set a reminder.</p></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Vinyl &amp; Turntable</h1><p class="muted">Afternoon, . The needle is older than you think.</p><div class="grid two"><div class="card"><h4 class="card-title">Stylus Hours</h4><div class="stat"><span class="value">41