44.54.0	dashboard_timeline/Houseplant Repotting Timeline	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Houseplant Repotting Timeline</h1><p class="muted">Roots need room, <regex>user_name</regex>. Spring is kindest; these steps are kind too.</p><div class="card"><div class="card-title">Before you start</div><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">Day -1</span><p>Water lightly. Damp roots slide out of a pot far more easily.</p></li><li><span class="when">Day 0, 0:00</span><p>Lay down paper. Gather a pot one size up, fresh mix, and scissors.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:05</span><p>Tip the plant out, supporting the stem. Tap the pot, do not yank.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:15</span><p>Unwind circling roots. Snip dead ones. Tease, do not tear.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:25</span><p>Fresh mix at the base, plant centred, soil to the old line, not higher.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:35</span><p>Water until it runs through, then let it drain fully.</p></li><li><span class="when">Day 1-7</span><p>Bright shade, no fertiliser, no fussing. New growth is the receipt.</p></li></ul></div><div class="callout good"><p class="t-small">Repot in spring or early summer. Winter transplants sulk.</p></div></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Houseplant Repotting Timeline</h1><p class="muted">Roots need room, . Spring is kindest; these steps are kind too.</p><div class="card"><div class="card-title">Before you start</div><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">Day -1</span><p>Water lightly. Damp roots slide out of a pot far more easily.</p></li><li><span class="when">Day 0, 0:00</span><p>Lay down paper. Gather a pot one size up, fresh mix, and scissors.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:05</span><p>Tip the plant out, supporting the stem. Tap the pot, do not yank.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:15</span><p>Unwind circling roots. Snip dead ones. Tease, do not tear.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:25</span><p>Fresh mix at the base, plant centred, soil to the old line, not higher.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:35</span><p>Water until it runs through, then let it drain fully.</p></li><li><span class="when">Day 1-7</span><p>Bright shade, no fertiliser, no fussing. New growth is the receipt.</p></li></ul></div><div class="callout good"><p class="t-small">Repot in spring or early summer. Winter transplants sulk.</p></div></div>	-
44.55.0	dashboard_timeline/Dinner Party Timeline	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Dinner Party Timeline</h1><p class="muted">Do the hardest part first, <regex>user_name</regex>, then pour yourself something.</p><div class="card"><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">Two days out</span><p>Pick a menu that shares one oven. Shop. Confirm who is coming.</p></li><li><span class="when">Day before</span><p>Make the dessert and salad dressing. Chop what keeps.</p></li><li><span class="when">-3 h</span><p>Set the table, chill drinks, clear the kitchen of clutter.</p></li><li><span class="when">-2 h</span><p>Main dish in the oven. Timer set. Write down your times on paper.</p></li><li><span class="when">-45 min</span><p>Shower and change. This is non-negotiable.</p></li><li><span class="when">-15 min</span><p>Portion starters, light candles, music on low.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:00</span><p>Guests arrive. Leave the kitchen. Sit down with them.</p></li></ul></div><details class="acc"><summary>The one rule</summary><div class="body"><p class="t-small">Nothing should require your attention in the first 20 minutes after they arrive.</p></div></details></div>	<div class="umi-page"><h1>Dinner Party Timeline</h1><p class="muted">Do the hardest part first, , then pour yourself something.</p><div class="card"><ul class="timeline"><li><span class="when">Two days out</span><p>Pick a menu that shares one oven. Shop. Confirm who is coming.</p></li><li><span class="when">Day before</span><p>Make the dessert and salad dressing. Chop what keeps.</p></li><li><span class="when">-3 h</span><p>Set the table, chill drinks, clear the kitchen of clutter.</p></li><li><span class="when">-2 h</span><p>Main dish in the oven. Timer set. Write down your times on paper.</p></li><li><span class="when">-45 min</span><p>Shower and change. This is non-negotiable.</p></li><li><span class="when">-15 min</span><p>Portion starters, light candles, music on low.</p></li><li><span class="when">0:00</span><p>